@using SandBox.Helpers
@using SandBox.Services

<p class="note">
    Pick a verse to see its connections.
</p>
<p>
    This tool uses the same data as the main website's application,
    but we follow the connections further down the chain.
    This gives us more cross references, and a hopefully better ordering.
    It sometimes also adds some context verses to those directly referenced.
</p>
<p>
    The scoring and the indicators evolve continuously, so it is not documented.
    Very, very basic idea of how scores are computed (each level adds less to the final score):
    <ul>
        <li><b>L1</b>: Direct references in this verse</li>
        <li><b>Incoming</b>: Verses which reference this verse</li>
        <li><b>L2</b>: References found for verses in L1 </li>
        <li><b>L3</b>: References found for verses in L2 </li>
    </ul>
</p>
<p>
    Best is to play around and understand it by using it.
</p>